        "text": "A tracker combines a GPS receiver, which calculates position from satellite signals, with a cellular connection that sends that position to a server. You see it in an app or web portal. Depending on the device and service, you may also get alerts for movement, ignition, geofence exits (leaving a defined area) or the tracker being disconnected."
